Cell["\<\
A trivial chiral Hamiltonian with identity polar factor has zero Bott \
expression.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->378101073,ExpressionUUID->"2c8196b4-333c-7148-acfb-ba350da3ce82"],

